Cell[TextData[{
 "Finally, and this is important, I delete the columns containing the number \
of points scored by each team.  This is information that would not be known \
prior to the occurrence of a game so we should not be taking it as an input \
to be used for the purpose of predicting future games.   \n\n",
 StyleBox["Note",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": I am hesitant to do this because I\[CloseCurlyQuote]m losing information \
and I would prefer to train on this information without requiring it as an \
input for making predictions.  Perhaps the way to do this is to train my net \
with these columns as additional outputs and to minimize losses across \
multiple outputs but at the time of writing this I haven\[CloseCurlyQuote]t \
figured out how to effectively implement this."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979663299976221*^9, 3.9796633786870956`*^9}, {
  3.9796634161875305`*^9, 3.9796635079937115`*^9}, {3.9796636254288425`*^9, 
