Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Encoding", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97982289524749*^9, 
  3.979822905700924*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1fa8f8bd-b174-0f49-a79d-\
0e68913f991e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "I use FeatureExtraction to define a FeatureExtractorFunction that will take \
my (training) input data and convert it to numeric form. \n\n",
 StyleBox["Note:",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " I tried various ways of doing this including doing it only on certain \
components of the input data, specifying whether I wanted the results to be \
indicator or standardized vectors, composing multiple extractors, and after \
all that it was simply default FeatureExtraction[] parameters that yielded \
the most effective results: "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9798229510607796`*^9, 3.9798230858435745`*^9}, {
  3.9798959583626385`*^9, 
  3.9798959889836006`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5904c51b-7526-7942-b1de-\
26f5a2e59f01"],

