Cell["\<\
I tested various values of DropoutProbability, Depth, Width, Method, \
L2Regularization, TrainingStoppingCriterion, and BatchSize by altering them \
one at a time to find the ideal combination of parameters for my net and \
training.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97983191634486*^9, 3.979832003165785*^9}, {
