Cell["\<\
Compare this to the 54.03% accuracy achieved by my net. 

Another measure of the accuracy of predictions is the RMSE (also called \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]StandardDeviation\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] in the \
context of regression measurements) and we want this to be as low as possible. 

The RMSE of my net\[CloseCurlyQuote]s predictions can be found as \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9798241627408447`*^9, 3.9798242225483513`*^9}, 
