Cell["\<\
Depending on randomization it appears that by the RMSE metric my net \
outperforms about half of the Predict methods. 

Let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s specifically compare Predict\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
NeuralNetwork to our net:\
\>", "Text",
